  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 701.03 Units of Measure for Maximum Contaminant Levels (MCLs) and Maximum Contaminant Level Goals (MCLGs)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 701.03 Units of Measure for Maximum Contaminant Levels (MCLs) and Maximum Contaminant Level Goals (MCLGs). The units of measure for MCLs and MCLGs shall be as follows:\n\n(a) Picocuries per liter, abbreviated as pCi/L;\n\n(b) Milligrams per liter, abbreviated as mg/L;\n\n(c) Micrograms per liter, abbreviated as μg/L;\n\n(d) Nanograms per liter, abbreviated as ng/L;\n\n(e) Millirem per year, abbreviated as mrem/year; and\n\n(f) Fibers per liter, abbreviated as fibers/L.\n\nSource. #9699, eff 5-1-10; ss by #12664, eff 1-1-19; amd by #12838, eff 9-30-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
}
